@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# Regression (FB2: CycleGuard unsound at scale). A legitimate recursive
# PersonShape (sh:node back to itself via sh:knows) walking a long chain
# of DISTINCT, ordinarily-named data nodes (n0..n2999, sequential naming --
# the exact pattern that broke the old TermSet-backed guard via the
# runtime's tombstone-less hash-table deletion). Must CONFORM in bounded
# time: no false-positive recursion error, no crash. Generated (3000
# nodes) -- see night-p2c/sliceB-fixround-report.md FB2 for how the
# depth budget below N=3000 interacts with this fixture's shape.
ex:PersonShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:Person ;
    sh:property [ sh:path ex:knows ; sh:node ex:PersonShape ] .

